{"segs": ["PA_ja_162:0.4"], "en": "2. The Saṇṭhava Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_162:1.1", "PA_ja_162:1.2"], "en": "\"There is nothing worse than intimacy, namely, intimacy with a base man.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_162:1.3"], "en": "Satisfied with ghee and milk-rice,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_162:1.4"], "en": "he burned the leaf-hut that had been built with such hardship.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_162:2.1"], "en": "There is nothing better than intimacy.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_162:2.2", "PA_ja_162:2.3"], "en": "The intimacy that exists with a true person is like the way the female panther licks the face of the lion, the tiger,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_162:2.4"], "en": "and the leopard out of familiarity.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
